Link: https://go-backend-ping.vercel.app/ping

I deployed the Go backend from exercise 1.13. The app only has the /ping
endpoint, so the main page / shows 404, which is expected.

What I did:
- I made a Dockerfile.vercel in the backend folder. I basically copied my
  Dockerfile from 1.13.
- On vercel.com I connected my GitHub account and picked my exercises
  repository. I set the backend folder as the root directory.
- I chose the Container preset so Vercel builds the image from my
  Dockerfile, and then I clicked deploy.

After the deploy finished, /ping answered with pong, so it works.